WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:02.250
Hello and welcome!

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:07.210
Since you clicked on this video, I guess you
are very interested to see how to generate

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:14.379
long-form story-like videos with this new
model from Google called Phenaki.

00:00:14.379 --> 00:00:19.789
Unlike the moving pictures we have seen in
our last explanation video from MetaAI’s

00:00:19.789 --> 00:00:25.849
Make-A-Video and Google’s Imagen Video,
Phenaki can generate longer videos from a

00:00:25.849 --> 00:00:30.410
sequence of text prompts and animate movies
with changing scenes!

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:33.900
And do you know what is crazy about Phenaki?

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.810
It’s not based on diffusion models!

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:42.940
Oh yes, this is surprising Ms. Coffee Bean
since AI art generation recently has been

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:45.710
dominated by diffusion models.

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:51.570
In this video, we will explain what Phenaki
is if not a diffusion model, and how it works

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:55.399
to generate potentially endless videos!

00:00:55.399 --> 00:00:59.940
But first, let’s thank Tasq.ai, the sponsor
of today’s video!

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:05.500
Tasq.ai is an innovative ultra scale data
labeling platform that leverages millions

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.790
of online users to task for digital content
consumption.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:15.680
Based on years of data science &amp; machine learning
practice and expertise, Tasq.ai developed

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:22.189
a unique method to logically break down complex
data to micro-tasks with simple decision data

00:01:22.189 --> 00:01:27.450
points, this way eliminating most mistakes
and ensuring high quality results with high

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:29.159
confidence scores.

00:01:29.159 --> 00:01:34.450
The micro-tasks are routed to millions of
global filtered online users for labeling

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:39.790
and then aggregated intelligently to create
high quality labeled datasets faster and more

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:43.009
cost effective than any other solution.

00:01:43.009 --> 00:01:48.900
Tasq.ai incentivizes online humans from more
than 200 countries and supports dozens of

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:57.650
languages, offering its clients diverse unbiased
results as well as specific geo-targeted locations.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:02.439
Tasq.ai assists dozens of the most innovative
data science teams to solve the bottleneck

00:02:02.439 --> 00:02:08.520
of labeled datasets faster and more cost effectively
